0 degree rotating nozzle disperses evenly throughout the space. Use i", "28 DB OPERATION FOR BETTER SLEEP: Our ultrasonic humidifier for bedroom operates at 28 dB, ensuring peaceful rest for babies, toddlers, and adults. Ideal for nurseries, dorms, or offices, it creates a", "BUILT-IN AROMA DIFFUSER FOR ESSENTIAL OILS: Add your preferred essential oils to the built-in aroma tray to enjoy a scented atmosphere while the humidifier releases cool mist. Combining humidification"]}}, "clips": {"B01EN6LTBA": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/78ac13a0-fde1-4c35-bafb-fb6c681144d4/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/5a550ae8-2104-4e50-97d0-aa529cd30e02/default.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/78ac13a0-fde1-4c35-bafb-fb6c681144d4/default.vertical.jobtemplate.mp4"], "B0DY1LB7XQ": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/1ac20f38-2cbb-4ab2-bc45-eeecbf64d447/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/ff4e5dd4-487f-4641-a540-b96d15d837de/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/6a6b25b6-b07d-4ea3-ac7d-353e839c28ce/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8"], "B0DFMYHT4D": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/83810486-e4ff-4309-9c98-6bef798dcd28/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/71dd8cf6-e063-4802-bec3-3f8b4d098b38/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8", "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/vse-vms-transcoding-artifact-us-east-1-prod/2981abbe-0f26-4031-9a49-77d864196c30/default.vertical.jobtemplate.hls.m3u8"], "B091JYX54W": ["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S